From 5f4fcf912b9a2e2dd424405633fe533df135257f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rponeawa <rponeawa@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:56:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix(metal): complete resource interfaces and use
 single-sample Poster rendering

Connect heap aliasability, swizzles, function constants and completion selectors, range blits, viewport arrays, inferred compressed input lengths, allocation statistics, and queue limits. Preserve function aliases across frontend retries. Keep Poster textures, pipelines, and resolves at one sample. Pixel and queue lifecycle checks pass over MoltenVK in both sample modes; iPadOS 27 frontend syntax check passes.

(cherry picked from commit 8c1ea136d5f756944c14661bf65724cc7baca7ff)
